<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  h1 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  h2 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 3fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-label { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .form-field-value { border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1>THE ARCHITECTURE MINOR REQUIREMENTS WORKSHEET</h1>

  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Name</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Pronouns</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="pronouns">{{ pronouns }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">School</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="school">{{ school }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Graduation Month/Year</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="graduation_date">{{ graduation_date }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Email</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Major Advisor</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="major_advisor">{{ major_advisor }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Date</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Other Major/Minor(s)</div>
      <div class="form-field-value"><span data-field="other_majors">{{ other_majors }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>There are 5 courses required for the Architecture Minor.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p>The minor is only open to <span data-field="eligible_students">{{ eligible_students }}</span>.</p>
      <p>No courses with a grade of D or lower may be counted in the minor.</p>
      <p>Architecture minors should meet with their course advisor every semester to review their course selection and progress in the minor.</p>
      <p>Minors should meet with an architecture advisor before finalizing their fall semester schedule.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>STUDIOS | 1-3 COURSES</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Course Code</th>
        <th style="width: 55%;">Course Title</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Sem/Year</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Grade</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Points</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in studio_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="studio_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].code">{{ studio_courses[loop.index0].code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="studio_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ studio_courses[loop.index0].title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="studio_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].semester_year">{{ studio_courses[loop.index0].semester_year }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="studio_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].grade">{{ studio_courses[loop.index0].grade }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="studio_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].points">{{ studio_courses[loop.index0].points }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>LECTURES, SEMINARS, AND WORKSHOPS | 2-4 COURSES</h2>
  <p>Lectures, Seminars, and Workshops are courses in architectural history, theory, and technology offered by the Architecture Department. Approved courses from related departments are noted each semester.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Course Code</th>
        <th style="width: 55%;">Course Title</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Sem/Year</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Grade</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Points</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in lecture_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="lecture_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].code">{{ lecture_courses[loop.index0].code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lecture_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ lecture_courses[loop.index0].title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lecture_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].semester_year">{{ lecture_courses[loop.index0].semester_year }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lecture_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].grade">{{ lecture_courses[loop.index0].grade }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="lecture_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].points">{{ lecture_courses[loop.index0].points }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>